    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>rectangle-clip-count · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rectangle-clip-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rectangle-clip-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const countsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; counts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const startFlagsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; startFlags: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const NO_LINE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn findLine(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  var high = LINE_COUNT + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  while (low &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">    if (lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= row) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  if (low == 0u || low &gt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    return NO_LINE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn getClip(row: u32) -&gt; vec3&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let line = findLine(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  if (line == NO_LINE || row + 1u &gt;= min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line + 1u], ROW_COUNT)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let a = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  let d = getPosition(row + 1u) - a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let lower = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(parameters[parametersOffset], parameters[parametersOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let upper = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(parameters[parametersOffset + 2u], parameters[parametersOffset + 3u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  var t0 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  var t1 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  var p = array&lt;f32, 4&gt;(-d.x, d.x, -d.y, d.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  var q = array&lt;f32, 4&gt;(a.x - lower.x, upper.x - a.x, a.y - lower.y, upper.y - a.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  for (var side = 0u; side &lt; 4u; side++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    if (p[side] == 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">      if (q[side] &lt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">        return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">      let r = q[side] / p[side];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">      if (p[side] &lt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">        if (r &gt; t1) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">          return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">        t0 = max(t0, r);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">        if (r &lt; t0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">          return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">        t1 = min(t1, r);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  // A single touching point is not a segment, except a genuinely zero-length input segment.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  if (t1 &lt; t0 || (t1 == t0 &amp;&amp; (d.x != 0.0 || d.y != 0.0))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  return vec3&lt;f32&gt;(t0, t1, 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">fn getLineStart(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  return lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + findLine(row)];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">fn isContinuation(row: u32, clip: vec3&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  if (clip.z == 0.0 || row == 0u || row &lt;= getLineStart(row)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">    return false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let previous = getClip(row - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  return previous.z != 0.0 &amp;&amp; previous.y == 1.0 &amp;&amp; clip.x == 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">fn getClippedStart(row: u32, clip: vec3&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  let a = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  return select(a + (getPosition(row + 1u) - a) * clip.x, a, clip.x == 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">fn getClippedEnd(row: u32, clip: vec3&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  let a = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  let b = getPosition(row + 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  return select(a + (b - a) * clip.y, b, clip.y == 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"107\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"108\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  _ = &amp;counts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  _ = &amp;startFlags;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  let clip = getClip(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  let continues = isContinuation(index, clip);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  counts[countsOffset + index] = select(0u, select(2u, 1u, continues), clip.z != 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  startFlags[startFlagsOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, clip.z != 0.0 &amp;&amp; !continues);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>counts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rectangle-clip-counts\">rectangle-clip-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>startFlags<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rectangle-clip-start-flags\">rectangle-clip-start-flags</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPURectangleClip/line-count · main · ebcb3d4d</figcaption></figure></section>",
